"A degenerate game from Chapter 6 (Algorithms for Mixed Strategy Nash Equilibria) of :cite:p:`ESW2X` whose equilibria all have supports of different sizes: player 1 mixes T and B with prob(T) between 1/3 and 2/3, and player 2 plays l. Used to motivate support enumeration for general bimatrix games."

